<myopenmath xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" id="122183">
<statement>
<p>
Suppose that R is the set of all rectangles and S is the set of all squares. Label each of the following as true or false.
</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{R}\subseteq{S}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>true</li> 
<li>false</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{S}\subseteq{R}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>true</li> 
<li>false</li> 
</ol></p>

</statement>
<solution>
<p><ul><li>B: false</li><li>A: true</li></ul></p>
</solution>
</myopenmath>

